<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="bg">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>@ViewData["Title"] - Училищна библиотека</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            font-family: "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            color: #e9e6f5;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 50% -10%, rgba(139, 108, 240, .22), transparent 55%),
                #0f0d1a;
            background-attachment: fixed;
        }

        header {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 60px 20px 54px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2a1f55, #46309a);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, .45);
        }

        header::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            height: 3px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #e2b866, transparent);
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 2.1rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .tagline {
            margin: 12px 0 0;
            font-size: .9rem;
            letter-spacing: .18em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #e2b866;
        }

        main {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 760px;
            min-height: 60vh;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 36px 32px;
            background: #181527;
            border: 1px solid #2c2746;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, .5);
            animation: rise .5s ease both;
        }

        @@keyframes rise {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
            to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        a { color: #fff; text-decoration: none; }
        a:hover { color: #e2b866; }

        .toolbar {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .search {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 240px;
        }

        input[type="text"] {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            color: #e9e6f5;
            background: #1f1b33;
            border: 1px solid #2c2746;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-family: inherit;
            font-size: .95rem;
        }

        input[type="text"]:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #8b6cf0;
        }

        .add-link {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            color: #e2b866;
            border: 1px solid #e2b866;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: .9rem;
            transition: background .15s;
        }

        .add-link:hover {
            color: #e2b866;
            background: rgba(226, 184, 102, .12);
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: separate;
            border-spacing: 0 12px;
        }

        th {
            padding: 10px 14px;
            font-size: .75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: .12em;
            text-align: center;
            color: #9792b8;
        }

        td {
            padding: 22px 14px;
            text-align: center;
            vertical-align: middle;
            background: #1f1b33;
            border-top: 1px solid #2c2746;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #2c2746;
            transition: background .2s;
        }

        td:first-child {
            border-left: 1px solid #2c2746;
            border-radius: 12px 0 0 12px;
            color: #e2b866;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        td:last-child {
            border-right: 1px solid #2c2746;
            border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0;
        }

        td:nth-child(2) { font-weight: 600; }
        td:nth-child(3) { color: #9792b8; font-style: italic; }

        tr:hover td { background: #272243; }

        .msg {
            padding: 16px 20px;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
            text-align: center;
            background: rgba(139, 108, 240, .14);
            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 108, 240, .45);
            border-radius: 12px;
            animation: rise .4s ease both;
        }

        .count {
            margin: 8px 0 0;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: .9rem;
            letter-spacing: .08em;
            color: #9792b8;
        }

        .empty {
            text-align: center;
            color: #9792b8;
        }

        .free  { color: #5fbf8f; font-weight: 600; }
        .taken { color: #d9708f; font-weight: 600; }

        .free::before, .taken::before {
            content: "";
            display: inline-block;
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            margin-right: 8px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: currentColor;
        }

        .details {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .details h2 {
            margin: 0 0 6px;
            font-size: 1.7rem;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .details .author {
            margin: 0 0 20px;
            color: #9792b8;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .details .add-link {
            margin-top: 22px;
        }

        .create-form {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 8px;
            max-width: 360px;
            margin: 24px auto 0;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .create-form label {
            font-size: .75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: .12em;
            color: #9792b8;
        }

        .create-form input[type="text"] {
            flex: none;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .create-form button {
            margin-top: 14px;
        }

        button {
            padding: 10px 24px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #fff;
            background: #6d4fd6;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 999px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background .15s, transform .15s;
        }

        button:hover {
            background: #8b6cf0;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        footer {
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            font-size: .8rem;
            letter-spacing: .1em;
            color: #9792b8;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
    <span class="logo">📚</span>
    <h1>Училищна библиотека</h1>
    <p class="tagline">Чети · Заеми · Открий</p>
</header>

<main>
    @RenderBody()
</main>

<footer>© Училищна библиотека</footer>
</body>
</html>